      "content": "what allergens are in strawberry flavoring?",
      "id": "8f9e814f-55f5-4252-8b8d-222846bdf2bc",
      "createdAt": "2025-07-10T22:45:23.204Z",
      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "what allergens are in strawberry flavoring?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-POiEFpFnkMumPQBrPnJEy2Pw",
      "createdAt": "2025-07-10T22:45:24.653Z",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Summary:**  \nThe reviewed supplier specification for strawberry flavoring indicates that it contains none of the major food allergens. The product is also gluten-free, kosher, and halal certified.\n\n---\n\n**Key Results:**\n\n- **Allergen Information (from California_Strawberry_Flavoring_Spec.pdf, Similarity: 64.2%):**\n  - **Contains:** None of the major allergens\n  - **Free from:** Dairy, Eggs, Fish, Shellfish, Tree nuts, Peanuts, Wheat, Soy\n  - **Gluten-free:** Yes\n  - **Kosher certified:** Yes (OU)\n  - **Halal certified:** Yes\n\n  > *\"ALLERGEN INFORMATION:  \n  Contains: None of the major allergens  \n  Free from: Dairy, Eggs, Fish, Shellfish, Tree nuts, Peanuts, Wheat, Soy  \n  Gluten-free: Yes  \n  Kosher certified: Yes (OU)  \n  Halal certified: Yes\"*\n\n- **Ingredients (for reference):**\n  - Natural strawberry flavor concentrate (45%)\n  - Organic cane sugar (25%)\n  - Citric acid (5%)\n  - Natural vanilla extract (3%)\n  - Ascorbic acid (Vitamin C) (2%)\n  - Natural red color from beetroot (1%)\n  - Filtered water (19%)\n\n---\n\n**Document Sources:**\n\n- **California_Strawberry_Flavoring_Spec.pdf** (Primary source, Similarity: 64.2%)\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps:**\n\n- If you need information on potential cross-contamination risks or facility allergen controls, request the supplier’s allergen control policy or a more detailed allergen statement.\n- For other strawberry flavoring products or different suppliers, specify the product name or supplier for a targeted search.\n- If you require information on other dietary certifications (e.g., vegan, non-GMO), let me know for a focused search.\n\nLet me know if you need allergen information for other flavorings or additional compliance details!",
      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "step-start"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Summary:**  \nThe reviewed supplier specification for strawberry flavoring indicates that it contains none of the major food allergens. The product is also gluten-free, kosher, and halal certified.\n\n---\n\n**Key Results:**\n\n- **Allergen Information (from California_Strawberry_Flavoring_Spec.pdf, Similarity: 64.2%):**\n  - **Contains:** None of the major allergens\n  - **Free from:** Dairy, Eggs, Fish, Shellfish, Tree nuts, Peanuts, Wheat, Soy\n  - **Gluten-free:** Yes\n  - **Kosher certified:** Yes (OU)\n  - **Halal certified:** Yes\n\n  > *\"ALLERGEN INFORMATION:  \n  Contains: None of the major allergens  \n  Free from: Dairy, Eggs, Fish, Shellfish, Tree nuts, Peanuts, Wheat, Soy  \n  Gluten-free: Yes  \n  Kosher certified: Yes (OU)  \n  Halal certified: Yes\"*\n\n- **Ingredients (for reference):**\n  - Natural strawberry flavor concentrate (45%)\n  - Organic cane sugar (25%)\n  - Citric acid (5%)\n  - Natural vanilla extract (3%)\n  - Ascorbic acid (Vitamin C) (2%)\n  - Natural red color from beetroot (1%)\n  - Filtered water (19%)\n\n---\n\n**Document Sources:**\n\n- **California_Strawberry_Flavoring_Spec.pdf** (Primary source, Similarity: 64.2%)\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps:**\n\n- If you need information on potential cross-contamination risks or facility allergen controls, request the supplier’s allergen control policy or a more detailed allergen statement.\n- For other strawberry flavoring products or different suppliers, specify the product name or supplier for a targeted search.\n- If you require information on other dietary certifications (e.g., vegan, non-GMO), let me know for a focused search.\n\nLet me know if you need allergen information for other flavorings or additional compliance details!"
        }
      ],
      "revisionId": "9028d8e1-3d1f-4394-b80c-5631af2045bd"
